Apache-2.0. DreamingOfClouds with Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), via Claude Code. The outside-session lanes behind the DYINGPAIR, SLACK
and GAPLEMMA proofs and the native-side census scripts are DreamingOfClouds'.

code/pricekit.py is our PRICEKIT, as shipped in #7607. data/w7546.json.gz is ToikY's #7546 word and data/7113_CALLER.json.gz is Rohan Arun's #7113
signed caller, both as vendored in #7606/#7607 and used as data only. The frontier words that the lane scripts read (our #7615 and #7617; #7612 by
Clear1nsight and #7616 by SYLforge in their lineage) are used as data only and are not shipped. The funded-return and courier conventions come from
the crowd chain #7480/#7481; the retag/slide edit family goes back to #7277 and #7612. Credit CubeJerry for the #6805 native and the P104 price and
replay lineage.

All checkers in this package are our own code; no code is imported from the repository or any other package, and no other author's open-PR code is run.
